This photo shows a tray after a meal, so very little food remains. There are sauce smears, probably soy sauce or a brown sauce, on the large plate, and a small cup holding a bit of dark sauce. The bowl has a trace of yellow residue, possibly egg yolk or oil. The napkins are not food.

I estimate about 10 g of residue in total, at roughly 1.5 kcal/g, which gives about 15 kcal.

